ions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":9675264,"digest":"sha256:5687238576fef087b876e521572989838b2605a444fbac7f561719cde5bee197","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-12T16:17:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T16:17:44Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/releases/download/v18.19.6/rccremote-windows64.exe"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joshyorko/rcc/tarball/v18.19.6","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joshyorko/rcc/zipball/v18.19.6","body":"## What's Changed\n* fix(release): validate supported N-1 archive rollback by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/222\n* fix(release): recover v18.19.5 from original verified artifacts by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/223\n* fix(anywork): honor parsed worker limit by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/227\n* test: preserve proxy routing for online artifact acceptance by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/228\n* test(benchmarks): measure isolated lifecycle consumers with exact receipts by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/229\n* docs: make provider hosting examples honor artifact trust policy by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/231\n* fix: accept padded trust root keys in offline verification by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/232\n* chore(security): build RCC with Go 1.26.9 security fixes by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/230\n* fix(uv): preserve internal links through aliased cache parents by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/234\n* chore(release): prepare RCC v18.19.6 by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/233\n* fix(release): separate verified preparation from approved publication by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/237\n* docs: complete contributor repository map by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/236\n* Export bounded source-bound release preparation receipts by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/238\n* test(anywork): cover scale capacity, queued work and worker panics by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/235\n* fix(release): verify expected N-1 catalog rebase by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/239\n* test(journal): cover persistence and lifecycle by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/240\n* Fix successful pip dependency listing fallback by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/243\n* fix(pathlib): preserve existing ancestor permissions by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/242\n* Handle diagnostic output and cache read failures by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/241\n* fix(operations): close network probe responses by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/244\n* Document v18.19.6 fixes and signing scope by @joshyorko in https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/245\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/compare/v18.19.5...v18.19.6","mentions_count":1}
